🤔 First – What is argparse?

Remember sys.argv?

sys.argv  →  Basic, no validation, no help
argparse  →  Professional, validation, auto help, types

sys.argv way:
python deploy.py production 8080

argparse way:
python deploy.py --env production --port 8080 --debug

argparse is used for:

✅ Accept arguments from command line
✅ Validate argument types automatically
✅ Show help message automatically
✅ Set default values
✅ Make arguments required or optional
✅ Build professional CLI tools
